    "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-06-19</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n            padding: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 8px 12px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        header h1 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        header .subtitle {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-top: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .stats {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            padding: 10px 12px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .stats strong {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .three-column-layout {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n            gap: 15px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1200px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            }\n            .technical-insights {\n                grid-column: 1 / -1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .column {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            padding: 12px;\n        }\n\n        .column-header {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #ff6600;\n            padding-bottom: 8px;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n        }\n\n        .item {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            padding-bottom: 12px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dotted #e5e5e5;\n        }\n\n        .item:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            padding-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            font-size: 13px;\n            font-weight: normal;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:visited {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #828282;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #828282;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            margin-right: 4px;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n            border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n        }\n\n        .source {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.feature {\n            background-color: #e8f5e9;\n            color: #2e7d32;\n            border: 1px solid #a5d6a7;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.announcement {\n            background-color: #fff3e0;\n            color: #e65100;\n            border: 1px solid #ffcc80;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.bugfix {\n            background-color: #ffebee;\n            color: #c62828;\n            border: 1px solid #ef9a9a;\n        }\n\n        .insight-author {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            font-style: italic;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .insight-topics {\n            margin-top: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.technical {\n            background-color: #e3f2fd;\n            color: #1565c0;\n            border: 1px solid #90caf9;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.opinion {\n            background-color: #fce4ec;\n            color: #c2185b;\n            border: 1px solid #f48fb1;\n        }\n\n        .quote {\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;\n            padding: 8px 10px;\n            margin: 8px 0;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #555555;\n        }\n\n        .quote-source {\n            display: block;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            color: #828282;\n            font-style: normal;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 15px;\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #828282;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        footer a:hover {\n            color: #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n                padding: 0;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                border: 1px solid #000000;\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n\n            .three-column-layout {\n                display: block;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                margin-bottom: 20px;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n            <h1>Agentic Coding Research Report</h1>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">Daily intelligence on AI coding tools, agents, and development workflows | 2026-06-19</div>\n        </header>\n\n        <div class=\"stats\">\n            <strong>Report Summary:</strong>\n            9 new products discovered |\n            13 whitelist updates tracked |\n            6 technical insights collected\n        </div>\n\n        <main class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <!-- New Products Column -->\n            <section class=\"column new-products\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">New Products (9)</div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/pi-coding-agent\" target=\"_blank\">Pi Coding Agent</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">A coding-agent harness that developers can customize, providing a programmable and model-agnostic shell for building and running AI coding agents with multi-agent architecture</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-18</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/swytchcode-cli\" target=\"_blank\">Swytchcode CLI</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">CLI tool for AI coding workflows</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-17</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/google-antigravity\" target=\"_blank\">Google Antigravity</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Run and monitor multiple coding agents simultaneously within an IDE, providing multi-agent coordination and orchestration across development environments</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-16</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/bobs-cli\" target=\"_blank\">Bob's CLI</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Local-first AI coding CLI that runs entirely on your machine without sending code to external servers, emphasizing privacy and data sovereignty</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-12</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/runtime\" target=\"_blank\">Runtime</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Sandboxed coding agents for development teams, focusing on governance, observability, and secure access to internal systems for production-grade AI coding workflows</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Workflow orchestration agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-13</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://github.com/vinhnx/vt-code\" target=\"_blank\">VT Code</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Open-source terminal coding agent written in Rust with semantic code intelligence via Tree-sitter parsers, providing fast and accurate code understanding</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Hacker News</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-13</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/spotlight-by-backplanes\" target=\"_blank\">Spotlight by Backplanes</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Session reports and analytics for Claude Code and Codex workflows, providing insights into AI coding agent usage patterns and helping teams understand their AI-assisted development</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Workflow-specific AI tools</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-10</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/agmsg\" target=\"_blank\">agmsg</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Tool to eliminate copy-pasting between AI coding agents by providing unified context sharing across different AI coding tools, streamlining multi-agent workflows</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Workflow-specific AI tools</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-09</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://github.com/MoonshotAI/kimi-cli\" target=\"_blank\">Kimi Code CLI</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Open-source TypeScript terminal AI coding agent with multi-agent architecture featuring built-in coder, explore, and plan sub-agents that work in parallel</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-06</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Column -->\n            <section class=\"column whitelist-updates\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">Whitelist Updates (13)</div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor Automations Improvements and BugBot Performance Boost</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">New /automate skill, GitHub/Slack triggers, cloud agent computer use support. BugBot now 3x faster, 22% cheaper, finds 10% more bugs</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-18</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\n                        BugBot switched to usage-based billing after June 8th, sparking discussion about iterative workflow impacts\n                        <span class=\"quote-source\">— Cursor Blog</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type announcement\">Announcement</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://developers.googleblog.com/an-important-update-transitioning-gemini-cli-to-antigravity-cli/\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini CLI Sunset - Transition to Antigravity CLI</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Gemini CLI being sunsetted on June 18, 2026, transitioning users to Antigravity CLI</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-18</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\n                        Mixed reactions about moving from open-source to proprietary solution\n                        <span class=\"quote-source\">— Hacker News</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type announcement\">Announcement</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/12138966-release-notes\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Fable 5 and Mythos 5 Model Updates</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Access suspended on June 12, shortly after Fable 5 launch on June 9 as Mythos-class model made safe for general use</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-12</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Devin Desktop v3.2.16 with Devin Local Plugin System</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">New Devin plugin system for extending Devin Local (enterprise preview), MCP tool support, terminal allow/deny lists</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-16</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\n                        Update resulted in 'a shiny looking IDE with bright colors' with positive reception\n                        <span class=\"quote-source\">— Reddit</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://aider.chat/HISTORY.html\" target=\"_blank\">Aider Main Branch Updates with New Model Support</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Added Claude 4.5/4.6, Gemini 2.5 Flash/Flash-Lite, Gemini 3 preview, DeepSeek Reasoner model support</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-15</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\n                        v0.86.2 remains latest stable release since February 12, with continuous main branch improvements\n                        <span class=\"quote-source\">— Developers Digest</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Devin Desktop v3.1.7 Agent/Editor Mode Smoothing</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Smoother Agent/Editor experience, switch to collapsed-sidebar titlebar, unified search icon, improved switching</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-10</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type bugfix\">Bugfix</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Devin Desktop v3.0.28 Migration and Performance Fixes</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Hardened Windows migration, improved file context handling, increased proxy timeout, fixed stdio MCP servers</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-06</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type announcement\">Announcement</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Windsurf Rebranded to Devin Desktop</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Major rebranding: Windsurf is now Devin Desktop. Over-the-air update preserved all plans, pricing, extensions, settings</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\n                        Rebrand from Windsurf to Devin Desktop was seamless for users\n                        <span class=\"quote-source\">— Releasebot.io</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type bugfix\">Bugfix</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Devin Desktop v3.0.21 Reset Migration Command</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Added reset migration command to give second chance importing extensions and settings from Windsurf</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-04</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type announcement\">Announcement</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-06-01-github-copilot-usage-based-billing\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot Usage-Based Billing Transition</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">GitHub moved from request-based to usage-based billing starting June 1, 2026. Costs now depend on model and interaction type</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-01</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/12138966-release-notes\" target=\"_blank\">Enterprise Custom Roles for Admin Permissions</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Extended custom roles framework adding admin permissions for specific areas like billing or privacy</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/12138966-release-notes\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Fable 5 Launch</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Anthropic launched Claude Fable 5, a Mythos-class model made safe for general use</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-09</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Column -->\n            <section class=\"column technical-insights\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">Technical Insights (6)</div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/18/datasette-apps/\" target=\"_blank\">Datasette Apps: Host custom HTML applications inside Datasette</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">New plugin allows hosting custom HTML applications with strict Content Security Policy and iframe permissions</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">datasette</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">sandboxing</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">html-applications</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-18</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/17/glm-52/\" target=\"_blank\">GLM-5.2 is probably the most powerful text-only open weights LLM</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">753B parameter Mixture-of-Experts model with 1M token context window under MIT license</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">llms</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">open-weights</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">glm</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-17</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/16/datasette-103a34/\" target=\"_blank\">Datasette 1.0a34: Tools to insert, edit and delete rows</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Alpha release adds UI tools for CRUD operations directly within Datasette interface</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">datasette</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">ui-design</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">database-tools</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-16</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/13/statement-on-fable-mythos-access/\" target=\"_blank\">The Fable 5 Export Controls: US Government Bans Claude Fable 5</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">US government suspended access to Fable 5/Mythos 5 for foreign nationals citing national security concerns</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">ai-policy</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">anthropic</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">export-controls</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-13</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/13/wasm-wheels-pypi-pyodide/\" target=\"_blank\">Publishing WASM wheels to PyPI for use with Pyodide</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Tool to publish WebAssembly wheels to PyPI for use with Pyodide (Python in browser)</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">python</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">webassembly</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">wasm</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-13</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/14/why-ai-hasnt-replaced-software-engineers/\" target=\"_blank\">Why AI hasn't replaced software engineers, and won't</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison (quoting Arvind Narayanan)</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Evidence rejects narrative of AI-caused layoffs: zero companies checked AI box on WARN notices in first year</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">ai-ethics</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">careers</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">software-engineering</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-06-14</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">View Previous Reports</a> |\n            <a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">Methodology</a> |\n            <a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">Submit Product</a> |\n            Report generated by Agent Code Daily - Powered by Claude Agent SDK\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
