    "originalFile": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-06-19</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 10px;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 5px 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n\n        header h1 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        header .date {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-top: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .three-column-layout {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n            gap: 15px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .technical-insights {\n                grid-column: 1 / -1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .technical-insights {\n                grid-column: 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        section {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            padding: 12px;\n        }\n\n        h2 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #ff6600;\n            padding-bottom: 5px;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n        }\n\n        .item {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            padding-bottom: 12px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\n        }\n\n        .item:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            padding-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:visited {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .description {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .metadata {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .metadata span {\n            margin-right: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .metadata a {\n            color: #828282;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .metadata a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #eeeeee;\n            color: #000000;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            margin-right: 4px;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #ff6600;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .community-quote {\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n            border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;\n            padding: 8px;\n            margin-top: 6px;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #555555;\n        }\n\n        .community-quote .source {\n            display: block;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n            font-style: normal;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 15px;\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #828282;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        footer a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            section {\n                border: 1px solid #000000;\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n\n            .three-column-layout {\n                display: block;\n            }\n\n            section {\n                margin-bottom: 20px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .insight-topics {\n            margin-top: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .author {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .key-takeaway {\n            display: block;\n            margin-top: 6px;\n            padding: 6px 8px;\n            background-color: #fff8e6;\n            border-left: 2px solid #ff6600;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #333333;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n            <h1>Agentic Coding Research Report</h1>\n            <div class=\"date\">June 19, 2026</div>\n        </header>\n\n        <main class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <!-- New Products Section -->\n            <section class=\"new-products\">\n                <h2>New Products</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/MoonshotAI/kimi-cli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kimi Code CLI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Open-source TypeScript terminal AI coding agent with multi-agent architecture featuring built-in coder, explore, and plan sub-agents that work in parallel to handle software development tasks and terminal operations\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span>Released: 2026-06-06</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>GitHub, MarkTechPost</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <h2>Product Updates</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cursor</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Feature</span>\n                        Automations improvements including /automate skill for creating automations in local agent sessions, new GitHub and Slack triggers, and cloud agent computer use support\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-18</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\n                        \"BugBot switched from $40/seat/month subscription to usage-based billing for Teams and Individual plans after June 8th, 2026\"\n                        <span class=\"source\">Cursor Blog</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Devin Desktop</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Feature</span>\n                        v3.2.16 with Devin plugin system for extending Devin Local, subagents can now call MCP tools directly, and teams can enforce terminal allow/deny lists through CLI permission scopes\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-16</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\n                        \"The update resulted in 'a shiny looking IDE with bright colors' and overall positive reception\"\n                        <span class=\"source\">Reddit</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://visualstudiomagazine.com/articles/2025/07/14/vs-code-v1-102-doubles-down-on-github-copilot-and-ai-enhanced-development.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub Copilot</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Feature</span>\n                        VS Code v1.102 June 2026 update turns on Autopilot by default and adds background sending for agent sessions\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-14</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\n                        \"Reddit discussion mentions custom agent mode features and terminal execution capabilities\"\n                        <span class=\"source\">Reddit r/GithubCopilot</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Devin Desktop</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Feature</span>\n                        v3.1.7 brings smoother Agent/Editor experience with switch added to collapsed-sidebar titlebar and improved switching\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-10</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Devin Desktop</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Bugfix</span>\n                        v3.0.28 hardened migration from Windsurf on Windows, improved file context handling, and fixed issues with stdio MCP servers\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-06</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2025-06-13-github-copilot-in-vs-code-may-release-v1-101\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub Copilot</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Release</span>\n                        May 2026 release (v1.101) delivers significant improvements to agent mode workflows and enhanced MCP support\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-13</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Devin Desktop</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Announcement</span>\n                        Windsurf rebranded to Devin Desktop - over-the-air update preserved all user plans, pricing, extensions, and settings\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\n                        \"The rebrand from Windsurf to Devin Desktop was seamless for users\"\n                        <span class=\"source\">Releasebot.io</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n                <h2>Technical Insights</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/18/datasette-apps/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Datasette Apps</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span> - Host custom HTML applications inside Datasette with sandboxing\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"key-takeaway\">\n                        New plugin focuses on strict Content Security Policy and iframe permissions for secure interactive applications\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">datasette</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">web-development</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">sandboxing</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-18</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/17/glm-52/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GLM-5.2 Open Weights LLM</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span> - Most powerful text-only open weights model\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"key-takeaway\">\n                        753B parameter Mixture-of-Experts model with 1M token context window under MIT license\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">llms</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">open-weights</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">glm</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-17</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/16/datasette-103a34/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Datasette 1.0a34</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span> - Tools to insert, edit and delete rows\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"key-takeaway\">\n                        \"Absurdity of having features in AI chat but not the main UI\" - inspired by Datasette Agent\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">datasette</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">ui-design</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">database-tools</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-16</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/14/why-ai-hasnt-replaced-software-engineers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AI & Software Engineering Jobs</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span> - Why AI hasn't replaced software engineers, and won't\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"key-takeaway\">\n                        Zero companies checked AI box on NY WARN notices - real bottlenecks are deciding/spec and verification\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">ai-ethics</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">careers</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">software-engineering</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-14</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/13/statement-on-fable-mythos-access/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fable 5 Export Controls</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span> - US government bans Claude Fable 5 for foreign nationals\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"key-takeaway\">\n                        Access cut off citing \"jailbreak\" - asking model to \"read codebase and fix flaws\" (defensive security task)\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">ai-policy</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">anthropic</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">export-controls</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-13</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/13/wasm-wheels-pypi-pyodide/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WASM Wheels for PyPI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span> - Publishing WASM wheels to PyPI for Pyodide\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"key-takeaway\">\n                        Tool enables Python packages to run directly in browser through WebAssembly\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">python</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">webassembly</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">wasm</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-13</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/11/claude-fable-is-relentlessly-proactive/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Fable Proactivity</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span> - Claude Fable is relentlessly proactive\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"key-takeaway\">\n                        \"Knows a whole lot of tricks and will deploy pretty much any of them to get to its goal\"\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">claude-fable</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">claude-code</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">coding-agents</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-11</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/10/datasette-agent-02a0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Datasette Agent 0.2a0</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span> - Tools can ask user questions mid-execution\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"key-takeaway\">\n                        New ask_user() method suspends agent turns until questions are answered, with persistent conversations\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">datasette-agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">ai-agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">human-in-the-loop</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-10</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/10/diffusiongemma/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DiffusionGemma Returns</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        <span class=\"author\">Simon Willison</span> - Google's open-weights diffusion model returns\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"key-takeaway\">\n                        Generated pelican image in 4.4 seconds achieving 500+ tokens/second on NVIDIA NIM\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">google</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">gemma</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">open-weights</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"metadata\">\n                        <span>2026-06-10</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <p>Agentic Coding Research Report | <a href=\"#\">Archive</a> | <a href=\"#\">About</a> | <a href=\"#\">Subscribe</a></p>\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">Generated with insights from Simon Willison and the agentic coding community</p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
